OL,3,GNEWSAPeople struggle to read health
OL,4,Aadvice, report says
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlmost one in three working-age adults
OL,7,Fin Surrey finds it difficult to
OL,8,Funderstand health advice, according to
OL,9,Fa council report.
OL,11,FThe document, due to be discussed by
OL,12,FSurrey's Health and Wellbeing Board and
OL,13,FIntegrated Care Partnership next week,
OL,14,Fsaid about 30% of adults aged 16 to 65
OL,15,Ffall below the threshold for health
OL,16,Fliteracy.
OL,18,FThe figure rises to 37% in Spelthorne,
OL,19,Fthe county's lowest-performing borough,
OL,20,Fwhile almost half of residents across
OL,21,FSurrey struggle when numeracy is
OL,22,Frequired.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
