OL,3,GNEWSAPeople struggle to read health
OL,4,Aadvice, report says
OL,5,
OL,6,FHealth literacy is defined as a
OL,7,Fperson's ability to access, understand
OL,8,Fand use information to make decisions
OL,9,Fabout their health and wellbeing.
